content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":93,"digest":"sha256:33fae67a2ff0436e4f19f3cb9ac565de45f3313f25169808933072358daa3b98","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-07-09T00:17:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T00:17:06Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mallcop-app/mallcop/releases/download/v0.11.0/mallcop-linux-arm64.tar.gz.sha256"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mallcop-app/mallcop/tarball/v0.11.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mallcop-app/mallcop/zipball/v0.11.0","body":"## Contents\n\nEach tarball contains `bin/` with all mallcop binaries:\n\n- `baseline` — baseline engine + CLI\n- `detector-*` — 13 security detectors\n- `mallcop` — customer scan CLI\n- `mallcop-finding-context` — WorkContext builder with injection defense\n- `notify-{telegram,slack,teams,email}` — delivery channels\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# Download (replace PLATFORM with linux-amd64, linux-arm64, or darwin-arm64)\ncurl -fsSLO https://github.com/mallcop-app/mallcop/releases/download/v0.11.0/mallcop-PLATFORM.tar.gz\ncurl -fsSLO https://github.com/mallcop-app/mallcop/releases/download/v0.11.0/mallcop-PLATFORM.tar.gz.sha256\nsha256sum -c mallcop-PLATFORM.tar.gz.sha256\ntar xzf mallcop-PLATFORM.tar.gz\nls bin/\n```\n\n### Features\n\n- feat(migrate): `mallcop migrate` upgrades an existing deploy repo in place (mallcoppro-973) (#163)\n\n### Other\n\n- backlog: default→triage (2b9), lookup_rules metadata schema (118), github_actor degrade (2a9), SHA-pin actions (796) (#164)\n\n---\n\n**Full changelog**: [`v0.10.1...v0.11.0`](https://github.com/mallcop-app/mallcop/compare/v0.10.1...v0.11.0)\n","short_description_html":"\u003ch2\u003eContents\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach tarball contains \u003ccode\u003ebin/\u003c/code\u003e with all mallcop binaries:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ccode\u003ebaseline\u003c/code\u003e — baseline engine + CLI\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ccode\u003edetector-*\u003c/code\u003e — 13 security detectors\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ccode\u003emallcop\u003c/code\u003e — customer scan CLI\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ccode\u003emallcop-finding-context\u003c/code\u003e — WorkContext…\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","is_short_description_html_truncated":true}},"public":true,"created_at":"2026-07-09T00:17:08Z","org":{"id":267132838,"login":"mallcop-app","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/orgs/mallcop-app","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267132838?"}},"unmapped_action":"ReleaseEvent"}}
